msgstr "Naciska przycisk „Włącz/wyłącz kamerę”"

#: addon\appModules\unigram.py:3057
msgid "Camera button not found"
msgstr "Nie znaleziono przycisku kamery"

#. Copy the focused link to the clipboard. For anything else we defer to Unigram's own
#. Ctrl+C, so the shortcut is never handled twice (Unigram can't copy just a link, and
#. its copy does not apply while the focus is on a link, so the two no longer conflict).
#: addon\appModules\unigram.py:3062
msgid ""
"Copy the message if it contains text. If the focus is on a link, the link "
"will be copied"
msgstr ""
"Kopiuje wiadomość, jeśli zawiera tekst. Jeśli fokus znajduje się na linku, "
"kopiuje link"

#: addon\appModules\unigram.py:3072
msgid "Link copied"
msgstr "Link skopiowany"

#. Move the focus to the message input field. If the focus is already in this field, then move it to the last element that had focus before this field
#: addon\appModules\unigram.py:3090
msgid ""
"Move the focus to the edit field. If the focus is already in the edit field, "
"then after pressing the hotkey, it will move to where it was before"
msgstr ""
"Przenosi fokus do pola edycji wiadomości. Jeśli fokus już się w nim "
"znajduje, przenosi go z powrotem do poprzednio aktywnego elementu"

#: addon\appModules\unigram.py:3107
msgid "Message input field not found"
msgstr "Nie znaleziono pola do wprowadzania wiadomości"

